OL,3,AWho does Iran trade with and what could
OL,4,ATrump's 'economic D-Day' mean?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has said "the single greatest
OL,7,Ffinancial offensive ever" will help it
OL,8,Fand Israel end their ongoing war with
OL,9,FIran.
OL,11,FHowever, Iran is no stranger to these
OL,12,Ftactics.
OL,14,FThe regime has faced near continuous US
OL,15,Fsanctions since the Islamic Revolution
OL,16,Fof 1979. In that time, it has developed
OL,17,Fdeep trade ties with several countries
OL,18,Fwhich either have a history of ignoring
OL,19,FUS economic pressure themselves or
OL,20,Fcannot afford to stop trading with
OL,21,FIran.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
