OL,3,AWho does Iran trade with and what could
OL,4,ATrump's 'economic D-Day' mean?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result, Iran says it is "fully
OL,7,Fprepared" for the new US sanctions and
OL,8,Fmany economists argue the impact of
OL,9,FWashington's latest move will be
OL,10,Flimited.
